ages/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_LOW_ShadowheartNote</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_ShadowheartNote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_ShadowheartNote\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">099b5fa8-f80e-4cbb-a7bc-ca5d6119ac4e</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:099b5fa8-f80e-4cbb-a7bc-ca5d6119ac4e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:099b5fa8-f80e-4cbb-a7bc-ca5d6119ac4e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Night_Orchid_Cave\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Night Orchid Cave\">Night Orchid Cave</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-378&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-1699</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Viconia_DeVir\" title=\"Viconia DeVir\">She</a> is going to make me look in the mirror again. She is going to take my memories. I <b>do not</b> want to forget who I am. I like flowers, I like animals, my name is -\n</p><p>[The writing breaks off with a jagged scrawl, as if interrupted.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195456\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1915/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30267/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7315/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 933795/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.141      1 -total\n 98.18%   45.301      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 64.32%   29.676      8 Template:Icon_text\n 58.02%   26.773     19 Template:Trim\n 34.05%   15.712      1 Template:PageSeo\n 33.94%   15.662      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 26.11%   12.047      2 Template:CharLink\n 25.96%   11.978      3 Template:Icon_link\n 21.36%    9.857      2 Template:Uid\n 20.41%    9.415      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12994-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195456 and revision id 365549. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}